{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/魔物料理专家","pageid":5669,"revid":15484,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E7%90%86%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E7%90%86%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E7%90%86%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>魔物料理专家</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.AD.94.E7.89.A9.E6.96.99.E7.90.86.E4.B8.93.E5.AE.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"魔物料理专家\"><b>魔物料理专家</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 魔物料理专家.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/67/5bcnbkmnbmes72mqs56vu4d3yeenyrz.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E7%90%86%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/67/5bcnbkmnbmes72mqs56vu4d3yeenyrz.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E6%96%99%E7%90%86%E4%B8%93%E5%AE%B6.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/67/5bcnbkmnbmes72mqs56vu4d3yeenyrz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />魔物料理专家\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，自身触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"料理\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">料理</font></span></span>]效果时，不会减少[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"料理\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">料理</font></span></span>]生命值。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，自身触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"料理\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">料理</font></span></span>]效果时，不会减少[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"料理\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">料理</font></span></span>]生命值。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"森西的满足\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">森西的满足</font></span></span>]大于<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>层时，可免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"定身\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">定身</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，自身触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"料理\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">料理</font></span></span>]效果时，不会减少[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"料理\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">料理</font></span></span>]生命值。拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"森西的满足\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">森西的满足</font></span></span>]大于<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>层时，可免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"定身\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">定身</font></span></span>]。行动开始时，获得1层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"森西的满足\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">森西的满足</font></span></span>]，若不足<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>层，则额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：80<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，三级：180<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"1\">可习得该极限解放的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%A3%AE%E8%A5%BF\" title=\"角色图鉴库/森西\"><img alt=\"头像 森西.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/78/r941lmbup1ygjzdhomf83xa1mqwx3la.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">森西</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164016\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.220 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.328 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3649/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34768/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7674/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransc